1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:40,700
=Episode 2=

5
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,681
My name is Zhang Luyao.

6
00:02:05,961 --> 00:02:07,240
Please wait a moment.

7
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,400
That's a very fine incense.

8
00:02:32,281 --> 00:02:33,400
I'll need to borrow it.

9
00:02:51,161 --> 00:02:52,201
Deputy Yu,

10
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,800
I'll step outside.

11
00:02:59,601 --> 00:03:00,560
Who is she?

12
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,400
A dancer.

13
00:03:08,608 --> 00:03:10,440
Wait about 8 minutes before going out.

14
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,680
The men outside have been drugged.

15
00:03:14,112 --> 00:03:15,400
The sedative is still in effect.

16
00:03:17,281 --> 00:03:19,041
I'll borrow your fine incense.

17
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,960
They'll be perfectly fine in 8 minutes.

18
00:03:34,321 --> 00:03:35,441
Forgive my intrusion.

19
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,921
I hope you won't take offense.

20
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,201
Whatever you wish to ask,

21
00:03:39,441 --> 00:03:40,800
I'll tell you everything I know.

22
00:03:41,441 --> 00:03:42,721
Once you have finished asking,

23
00:03:43,441 --> 00:03:45,080
I'll ask my own questions.

24
00:03:56,441 --> 00:03:57,921
Is this incense of mine

25
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,201
any good?

26
00:04:00,921 --> 00:04:02,441
It should be seven sticks to a bundle.

27
00:04:03,441 --> 00:04:06,120
Four taels of sandalwood,
two taels of agarwood,

28
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,960
3.7 g of storax,

29
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,881
18.5 g each of clove and cinnamon,

30
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,520
and 3.7 g of ambergris.

31
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,481
Beyond that,
I can't identify the ingredients.

32
00:04:15,321 --> 00:04:16,680
It's incense of the finest quality.

33
00:04:25,161 --> 00:04:26,320
I mean no disrespect

34
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:27,521
to sit.

35
00:04:28,208 --> 00:04:30,000
I'm frail and easily short of breath.

36
00:04:30,704 --> 00:04:32,600
I need to rest
after moving around for a while.

37
00:04:35,568 --> 00:04:37,680
You drugged the guards
and entered without permission.

38
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,921
You've got some nerve.

39
00:04:41,081 --> 00:04:42,880
Liangzhou is just
a small frontier guard.

40
00:04:43,216 --> 00:04:45,080
You're the official responsible
for its people.

41
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,680
Twenty-seven of my family died.

42
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,601
Crying won't change anything.

43
00:04:50,096 --> 00:04:51,990
Should I just sit and wait
at the Escort Agency

44
00:04:52,081 --> 00:04:53,601
instead of coming here?

45
00:05:00,176 --> 00:05:01,950
Deputy Military Commissioner,
do you always

46
00:05:02,401 --> 00:05:04,041
look people straight in the eye?

47
00:05:05,601 --> 00:05:06,721
That's not a good habit.

48
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,568
The sedative outside
hasn't worn off yet.

49
00:05:19,041 --> 00:05:20,240
Let's talk for a while,

50
00:05:21,841 --> 00:05:23,601
and then you and I can leave together.

51
00:05:24,721 --> 00:05:26,120
What's wrong with

52
00:05:27,504 --> 00:05:29,232
looking someone straight in the eye?

53
00:05:31,041 --> 00:05:33,120
It lets people see
what kind of person you are.

54
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,601
What kind of person am I?

55
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,161
You're proud at heart

56
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,360
but cautious in your conduct.

57
00:05:46,384 --> 00:05:47,960
You observe the proper order of rank.

58
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,521
What makes you say that?

59
00:05:53,161 --> 00:05:54,841
Your outer robe is gauze over silk.

60
00:05:54,992 --> 00:05:56,800
It uses neither
colorful weaving nor dyeing,

61
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,481
nor any gold or silver thread.

62
00:05:59,281 --> 00:06:00,601
That shows your restraint.

63
00:06:08,081 --> 00:06:09,880
But the gauze
bears subtle hidden patterns.

64
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,401
With the slightest movement,

65
00:06:13,721 --> 00:06:15,560
the patterns beneath emerge,

66
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:18,521
like flowing streams and pine trees.

67
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:20,961
That reveals your pride.

68
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:24,370
Clothes like these are rare,
let alone in the Northwest.

69
00:06:24,401 --> 00:06:26,000
Even in Yangzhou, they're seldom seen.

70
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,560
But clothes can't conceal your eyes.

71
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,841
Your eyes are filled with weariness.

72
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,401
What am I weary of?

73
00:06:37,161 --> 00:06:38,120
I don't know.

74
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,601
I only want to know

75
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:44,120
how the 27 members of my family died.

76
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,641
Deputy Yu,

77
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,481
how did my father and brothers

78
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:53,360
die?

79
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,800
The poison was put in the horse feed.

80
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,521
We don't know
how the poison takes effect

81
00:07:15,161 --> 00:07:16,800
or how to cure it.

82
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:21,120
Both groups at Lieyang Well
and Shiquan Fort were wiped out?

83
00:07:21,961 --> 00:07:23,320
The guardians of the gold did it.

84
00:07:25,601 --> 00:07:28,000
There really are
300,000 taels of gold in the desert?

85
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,481
Someone already knows
where the gold is buried.

86
00:07:30,784 --> 00:07:33,424
They tried to reach it twice,
and everyone died both times.

87
00:07:33,921 --> 00:07:35,961
So they turned
to the Zhang Escort Agency.

88
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,880
My father and brothers were honest men.

89
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,320
They had no extraordinary abilities.

90
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,641
Who thought so highly
of the Zhang family?

91
00:07:45,161 --> 00:07:47,120
Who gave the Zhangs the escort contract?

92
00:07:48,896 --> 00:07:50,160
I'd like to know that, too.

93
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,961
Deputy Yu,

94
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,760
Miss Zhang,

95
00:07:57,281 --> 00:07:58,401
what you're discussing

96
00:07:58,401 --> 00:08:00,120
shouldn't be overheard by outsiders.

97
00:08:00,281 --> 00:08:01,281
I'll step outside.

98
00:08:07,281 --> 00:08:07,961
What's going on?

99
00:08:07,961 --> 00:08:09,180
Why is everyone on the ground?

100
00:08:11,184 --> 00:08:11,840
Come quickly...

101
00:08:11,961 --> 00:08:14,360
Who are you to block the Deputy
Military Commissioner's door?

102
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:15,360
Move aside!

103
00:08:15,664 --> 00:08:17,312
Protect the Deputy
Military Commissioner!

104
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,001
Pingping,

105
00:08:46,241 --> 00:08:46,800
come back.

106
00:09:16,641 --> 00:09:17,480
Mr. Wu,

107
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,161
it's me, Luyao.

108
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,960
Weren't all 27 Zhangs

109
00:09:41,761 --> 00:09:43,080
supposed to be dead?

110
00:09:43,281 --> 00:09:44,641
We just found this man.

111
00:10:24,161 --> 00:10:24,921
Mr. Wu,

112
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,960
it's me, Luyao.

113
00:10:39,361 --> 00:10:41,600
Who brought the Zhang family
the escort contract?

114
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,041
Tell me.

115
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,521
It's all right.

116
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,800
Could you let me out?

117
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,200
Could you let me through?

118
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,200
Let me through.

119
00:11:55,921 --> 00:11:56,800
Mr. Wu,

120
00:11:57,401 --> 00:11:59,281
who gave the Zhangs the escort contract?

121
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,001
Is that person here?

122
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,320
Seven.

123
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:36,800
Deputy Yu,

124
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,320
is he one of your men?

125
00:12:41,001 --> 00:12:41,840
No.

126
00:12:43,041 --> 00:12:44,200
Of course not.

127
00:12:45,001 --> 00:12:46,960
So, why is he at your residence?

128
00:12:48,001 --> 00:12:49,080
You'll have to ask him.

129
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,840
Who do you think you are?

130
00:12:56,921 --> 00:12:58,761
Even the General means nothing to us.

131
00:13:01,241 --> 00:13:02,800
In our eyes,

132
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,720
people like you

133
00:13:05,281 --> 00:13:06,560
are nothing.

134
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,728
Deputy Yu, are you going to silence him?

135
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,121
I am.

136
00:13:39,881 --> 00:13:40,600
Deputy,

137
00:13:41,008 --> 00:13:42,352
Officer Pu has gone mad.

138
00:13:42,368 --> 00:13:44,464
He's attacking people
at the Zhang Escort Agency.

139
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:46,560
Chi...

140
00:13:46,672 --> 00:13:49,408
Chi said the poison from the guardians'
fodder has taken effect.

141
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,200
Block the door.

142
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,361
Don't let him out.

143
00:14:40,161 --> 00:14:41,281
Officer Pu.

144
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,041
Officer Pu,

145
00:14:44,048 --> 00:14:46,050
I'm the Deputy
Military Commissioner of Liangzhou.

146
00:14:46,064 --> 00:14:47,320
Be careful, Deputy.

147
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,281
He won't listen to anything now.

148
00:14:52,048 --> 00:14:54,900
If Officer Pu sheds even a drop of
blood or suffers the slightest injury,

149
00:14:54,944 --> 00:14:55,600
you'll die.

150
00:14:55,881 --> 00:14:58,440
No, he insisted on smelling
the poisoned horse feed himself.

151
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:00,320
I smelled it and was fine.

152
00:15:01,881 --> 00:15:03,161
Doesn't he want the gold?

153
00:15:04,001 --> 00:15:06,401
200 taels is too much.
Who would dare take it?

154
00:15:07,184 --> 00:15:08,920
Could it be the guardians of the gold...

155
00:15:08,921 --> 00:15:09,761
Shut up.

156
00:15:09,761 --> 00:15:10,761
(Zhang Escort Agency)

157
00:15:25,361 --> 00:15:26,720
You're weak

158
00:15:27,248 --> 00:15:28,680
but highly skilled in martial arts.

159
00:15:32,001 --> 00:15:33,960
You should be more skilled than I am.

160
00:15:34,576 --> 00:15:36,144
My skills are different from yours.

161
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,560
Long spears and halberds,

162
00:15:37,570 --> 00:15:39,250
fighting in formation
and risking my life.

163
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,281
They're only meant for killing.

164
00:15:44,161 --> 00:15:45,440
You didn't know the dancer

165
00:15:46,121 --> 00:15:47,560
and the man who took his own life,

166
00:15:48,881 --> 00:15:50,401
did you, Deputy?

167
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:52,881
No.

168
00:15:56,401 --> 00:15:58,641
They're all people
after the 300,000 taels of gold.

169
00:16:04,281 --> 00:16:05,921
Don't you want the gold, Deputy?

170
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,480
I've never met

171
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:16,200
anyone like you.

172
00:16:17,616 --> 00:16:19,264
Have you ever been to Jiangnan?

173
00:16:20,361 --> 00:16:21,200
No.

174
00:16:21,641 --> 00:16:22,720
So how did you know

175
00:16:23,361 --> 00:16:25,440
my clothes are rare even in Yangzhou?

176
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:28,600
You never wear

177
00:16:29,641 --> 00:16:31,241
those clothes outside, do you?

178
00:16:33,001 --> 00:16:33,680
No.

179
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,960
Why don't you leave?

180
00:16:42,881 --> 00:16:43,641
Leave?

181
00:16:46,161 --> 00:16:47,680
Leave the desert and go to Jiangnan.

182
00:16:55,761 --> 00:16:57,480
I joined the army at 19.

183
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,521
In this life,

184
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,001
I'll never leave
the Northwestern desert.

185
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:10,121
Don't look at me like that.

186
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:15,720
If your thoughts are seen through,

187
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,000
you would kill?

188
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,760
What thoughts?

189
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:27,561
Your eyes are weary,

190
00:17:28,801 --> 00:17:30,121
but your heart is uneasy.

191
00:17:35,881 --> 00:17:37,200
Uneasy enough to kill?

192
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,240
If you kill Pingping and me,

193
00:17:39,881 --> 00:17:41,161
that would just add two more

194
00:17:41,161 --> 00:17:42,480
to the twenty-seven already dead.

195
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,641
You haven't made a move.

196
00:17:45,881 --> 00:17:47,561
Is it because you
need something from me,

197
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:49,720
or because

198
00:17:49,808 --> 00:17:52,224
you're the official responsible
for the people of Liangzhou?

199
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:57,561
I need something from you.

200
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,601
Deputy, give your order.

201
00:18:09,321 --> 00:18:10,300
In the armory is an

202
00:18:10,310 --> 00:18:12,990
Embroidered Uniform Guard officer
sent by the Court to investigate.

203
00:18:13,081 --> 00:18:14,081
He's seventh rank.

204
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:17,161
If he breaks out,

205
00:18:17,248 --> 00:18:18,800
I'll have no choice but to kill him.

206
00:18:18,921 --> 00:18:20,321
That wouldn't be good for any of us.

207
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,161
I'd like to ask you

208
00:18:27,328 --> 00:18:28,520
to cure him of the poison.

209
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,520
What poison?

210
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:35,881
It's in the hat.

211
00:18:36,512 --> 00:18:38,496
The poison used
by the guardians of the gold.

212
00:18:40,321 --> 00:18:41,641
What case is he investigating?

213
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,881
Shiquan Fort, Lieyang Well,

214
00:18:44,561 --> 00:18:45,520
and the massacre

215
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,480
of your family.

216
00:18:50,881 --> 00:18:51,641
Can you do it?

217
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:16,780
(Blacksmith Shop)

218
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:19,121
Miss,

219
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,200
where are we taking this?

220
00:19:23,361 --> 00:19:24,561
Zhang Escort Agency.

221
00:19:29,921 --> 00:19:31,121
Go.

222
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,480
Hurry.

223
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,561
Hurry.

224
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:25,801
Deputy,

225
00:20:26,401 --> 00:20:27,240
the officer

226
00:20:27,561 --> 00:20:28,361
has collapsed.

227
00:20:29,801 --> 00:20:31,081
He's down.

228
00:20:31,641 --> 00:20:32,720
What's his name?

229
00:20:33,641 --> 00:20:35,200
Officer Pu Ying.

230
00:20:56,121 --> 00:20:57,040
Deputy!

231
00:20:57,841 --> 00:20:59,081
What is it?

232
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:00,240
Coroner,

233
00:21:00,361 --> 00:21:02,641
they said we should go carry in
the food and liquor.

234
00:21:03,321 --> 00:21:04,200
Who?

235
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:05,121
Well...

236
00:21:05,361 --> 00:21:06,121
Me!

237
00:21:16,561 --> 00:21:17,480
Officer Pu.

238
00:21:33,081 --> 00:21:34,240
Open your eyes.

239
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:40,801
Can you see me?

240
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,161
Yes.

241
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:50,272
When this poison takes effect,
everyone looks like a vengeful ghost.

242
00:21:50,641 --> 00:21:51,881
You're all right now.

243
00:21:59,921 --> 00:22:01,440
It was like a dream.

244
00:22:07,881 --> 00:22:09,280
I'm Zhang Luyao.

245
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:13,641
The 27 people of the Zhang Escort Agency

246
00:22:14,144 --> 00:22:16,352
were all my family,
including my father and brothers.

247
00:22:19,904 --> 00:22:22,200
5 years ago, I married
into the Tang Clan in Northern Shu.

248
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,240
For the first 3 years,

249
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:27,240
I tested 236 poisons for the Tang Clan.

250
00:22:28,601 --> 00:22:30,440
I came close to death 100 times.

251
00:22:31,632 --> 00:22:33,880
The benefit is that
I'm now immune to all poisons,

252
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:35,650
and my martial arts
have improved greatly.

253
00:22:36,561 --> 00:22:37,641
The downside

254
00:22:37,650 --> 00:22:39,776
is I've been frail
and short of breath ever since,

255
00:22:40,921 --> 00:22:43,520
and I never got to see
my family one last time.

256
00:22:46,520 --> 00:22:47,680
What do you mean?

257
00:22:53,121 --> 00:22:54,680
I grew up in the Northwest.

258
00:22:56,040 --> 00:22:57,361
I've never heard

259
00:22:57,361 --> 00:22:59,720
of 300,000 taels of gold
hidden in the desert.

260
00:23:02,520 --> 00:23:04,081
If it weren't for the gold,

261
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,561
in this lifetime,

262
00:23:08,321 --> 00:23:09,841
we would never have met.

263
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:17,321
Move.

264
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,760
Seeing you

265
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:23,841
feels like a dream.

266
00:23:29,401 --> 00:23:31,081
Officer Pu, try standing up.

267
00:23:41,121 --> 00:23:43,121
I've cured you
of the poison from the feed,

268
00:23:43,841 --> 00:23:45,401
but I've also given you a new poison.

269
00:24:00,601 --> 00:24:02,200
Officer Pu, take a breath.

270
00:24:05,641 --> 00:24:06,480
Do your Chong

271
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:07,841
and Yang Heel Meridians

272
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:10,280
feel slightly painful or blocked?

273
00:24:14,720 --> 00:24:15,921
Take another breath.

274
00:24:17,361 --> 00:24:18,161
A deep breath.

275
00:24:23,081 --> 00:24:25,000
Your Baihui and Fengchi points
are throbbing.

276
00:24:25,361 --> 00:24:28,520
From now on, breathe gently
and speak softly.

277
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:30,752
Otherwise, you'll lose
your senses and your mind.

278
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:33,000
I feel perfectly fine.

279
00:24:33,561 --> 00:24:35,000
I'm not falling for your nonsense.

280
00:24:36,561 --> 00:24:37,921
You can stand up now.

281
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,680
Don't walk forward.

282
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,200
Take 3 steps to either side.

283
00:25:14,976 --> 00:25:17,248
You'll feel a chill
in the joints below your waist.

284
00:25:17,360 --> 00:25:20,352
The poison travels through the Ren
Meridian and blocks the Shenmen point.

285
00:25:20,760 --> 00:25:22,561
I'll give you an antidote every 5 days.

286
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:25,921
Miss,

287
00:25:26,801 --> 00:25:28,401
we have no quarrel with each other.

288
00:25:34,280 --> 00:25:35,960
Officer Pu, you came from the Capital

289
00:25:37,121 --> 00:25:38,720
to find the guardians of the gold

290
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:41,000
or to catch the killers?

291
00:25:42,760 --> 00:25:44,161
I'm all alone.

292
00:25:44,841 --> 00:25:47,641
No one in the Liangzhou or
Ganzhou Guard can be trusted.

293
00:25:49,081 --> 00:25:51,361
That's why I poisoned you
and asked for your help.

294
00:25:52,601 --> 00:25:53,841
Once we find the killers,

295
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:56,401
I'll cure you of the poison, and submit

296
00:25:56,416 --> 00:25:58,030
to whatever punishment you decide.

297
00:25:58,040 --> 00:25:59,561
What if I kill you?

298
00:26:01,520 --> 00:26:02,361
I'll die,

299
00:26:03,264 --> 00:26:04,880
and the poison will leave you crippled.

300
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:07,321
I'll kill you right now.

301
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:10,040
Walk slowly.

302
00:26:10,416 --> 00:26:12,040
Come out and have some liquor and meat.

303
00:26:23,081 --> 00:26:24,401
How is it? Is there enough to eat?

304
00:26:24,410 --> 00:26:25,056
Eat some more.

305
00:27:05,601 --> 00:27:06,960
We should honor the dead,

306
00:27:08,520 --> 00:27:09,321
but this liquor,

307
00:27:09,321 --> 00:27:10,480
I'd rather not pour it out.

308
00:27:10,921 --> 00:27:11,801
Can I drink it?

309
00:27:12,601 --> 00:27:13,720
As you wish, Officer Pu.

310
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:14,561
I wasn't asking you.

311
00:27:15,921 --> 00:27:17,081
Can I drink it?

312
00:27:18,040 --> 00:27:18,801
Yes.

313
00:27:19,760 --> 00:27:21,160
Don't say that unless you're sure.

314
00:27:22,760 --> 00:27:23,881
You really can.

315
00:27:32,200 --> 00:27:33,240
Miss Luyao,

316
00:27:33,408 --> 00:27:35,000
have you cured Officer Pu of the poison?

317
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:38,240
Was it easy?

318
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:39,841
Very easy.

319
00:27:40,881 --> 00:27:42,601
It's nothing particularly potent.

320
00:27:44,040 --> 00:27:46,280
It won't take effect
while mixed in the fodder.

321
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:48,760
Only after cattle or horses chew it,

322
00:27:48,784 --> 00:27:50,160
and their saliva mixes with water,

323
00:27:50,161 --> 00:27:51,801
does the poison become airborne.

324
00:27:52,121 --> 00:27:53,921
It's most potent within 10 paces.

325
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:57,100
Anyone who inhales it goes mad
as if possessed by a vengeful ghost.

326
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:59,920
But spray it with clean water,
and the poison dissipates immediately.

327
00:28:03,881 --> 00:28:05,480
Where does that poison come from?

328
00:28:05,921 --> 00:28:07,000
Who made it?

329
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:08,361
Who knows how to use it?

330
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,881
Is it a poison used
by someone here in Gansu

331
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,680
or by a sect from another province?

332
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:27,280
I have to eat.

333
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:28,921
5 times a day.

334
00:28:29,361 --> 00:28:30,361
Just a little each time.

335
00:28:30,361 --> 00:28:31,040
Eat.

336
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:36,240
May I see the bell in your pouch?

337
00:28:37,360 --> 00:28:38,680
It's just an ordinary old bell.

338
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:40,081
I saw you use it

339
00:28:40,081 --> 00:28:41,881
to take down Officer Pu with ease.

340
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:43,841
Yu Hou!

341
00:28:43,841 --> 00:28:44,680
Deputy!

342
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:47,280
You think you're quite something, huh?

343
00:28:47,361 --> 00:28:48,081
I wouldn't dare.

344
00:28:56,624 --> 00:28:59,440
I came all the way from the Capital
to Liangzhou to investigate a case.

345
00:28:59,881 --> 00:29:01,401
You sent a coroner

346
00:29:01,561 --> 00:29:03,680
to get rid of me with 200 taels of gold.

347
00:29:04,280 --> 00:29:05,561
I traveled all this way,

348
00:29:05,561 --> 00:29:07,680
and you expected me
to travel all the way back.

349
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:10,240
How could this happen?

350
00:29:13,601 --> 00:29:15,121
You've got some nerve.

351
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:18,760
200 taels of gold is a vast sum.

352
00:29:19,841 --> 00:29:22,200
Is everyone in Gansu really that lavish?

353
00:29:22,801 --> 00:29:24,121
How could that be?

354
00:29:25,081 --> 00:29:26,200
The 200 taels of gold

355
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:28,720
are evidence
in the Zhang family massacre.

356
00:29:33,561 --> 00:29:35,000
The 200 taels of gold

357
00:29:35,696 --> 00:29:38,120
were the fee paid to
the Zhang Escort Agency for this job.

358
00:29:43,392 --> 00:29:45,632
My father and brothers
are gone, but I'm still here.

359
00:29:46,161 --> 00:29:47,401
When entrusted with a task,

360
00:29:48,161 --> 00:29:49,520
I must see it through.

361
00:29:53,040 --> 00:29:54,081
What do you mean?

362
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:58,841
Whoever is willing to go
to Lieyang Well and Shiquan Fort,

363
00:29:59,480 --> 00:30:01,801
risk their life, and head west with me

364
00:30:01,801 --> 00:30:04,081
to meet
the murderous guardians of the gold

365
00:30:07,561 --> 00:30:08,480
gets these

366
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,561
200 taels of gold.

367
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:13,321
The journey west is dangerous.

368
00:30:14,321 --> 00:30:15,401
Miss Luyao,

369
00:30:15,712 --> 00:30:17,968
tell me where the poison
from the fodder comes from.

370
00:30:18,040 --> 00:30:19,000
The Liangzhou Guard

371
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,528
will capture the guardians of the gold

372
00:30:20,544 --> 00:30:22,688
and seek justice
for the 27 members of your family.

373
00:30:25,321 --> 00:30:26,321
Deputy Yu,

374
00:30:28,321 --> 00:30:29,760
I don't trust you.

375
00:30:32,784 --> 00:30:35,680
I still haven't determined where
the poison from the fodder comes from.

376
00:30:36,081 --> 00:30:37,161
Once I head west,

377
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,841
the people who killed my family

378
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:41,280
will reveal themselves.

379
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:46,000
In the Northwestern desert,
if you can't trust me,

380
00:30:46,561 --> 00:30:48,081
who can you trust?

381
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:52,040
I trust Officer Pu.

382
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:59,520
And I trust the desperate men
who will come for 200 taels of gold.

383
00:31:04,980 --> 00:31:07,620
(Zhang Escort Agency.
300,000 Taels of Gold)

384
00:31:17,601 --> 00:31:18,520
Come on, drink!

385
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,520
What are you doing?

386
00:31:36,520 --> 00:31:37,200
Go back.

387
00:31:41,801 --> 00:31:43,601
Go where? Do what?

388
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:45,841
Another round!

389
00:32:06,881 --> 00:32:08,161
Buy something.

390
00:32:24,641 --> 00:32:25,520
Futu!

391
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,601
Where is Futu?

392
00:32:32,040 --> 00:32:32,801
Futu!

393
00:32:33,520 --> 00:32:34,321
Futu,

394
00:32:36,921 --> 00:32:38,480
Seven and Sixteen are both dead.

395
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:43,641
What did you say?

396
00:32:43,921 --> 00:32:45,280
Seven killed Sixteen

397
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:47,161
and killed himself.

398
00:33:25,361 --> 00:33:26,921
The Zhang family is wiped out?

399
00:33:27,801 --> 00:33:28,561
No.

400
00:33:29,081 --> 00:33:30,760
The poisoned escort has been silenced.

401
00:33:31,072 --> 00:33:33,000
But the Zhang lady
accepted the escort order.

402
00:33:33,392 --> 00:33:35,200
She's going to use
the 200 taels of escort fee

403
00:33:35,216 --> 00:33:36,656
to hire people to escort her west.

404
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,520
Escort what?

405
00:33:39,401 --> 00:33:40,720
Yu Hou didn't ask her

406
00:33:40,768 --> 00:33:42,640
where the poison
from the fodder came from?

407
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,321
I don't know.

408
00:33:45,881 --> 00:33:47,881
What kind of escort job
can a woman take on?

409
00:33:48,641 --> 00:33:50,520
Where are the 300,000 taels of gold?

410
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:51,881
Where are they heading?

411
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:54,641
First to Lieyang Well,
and then to Shiquan Fort.

412
00:33:54,752 --> 00:33:56,080
That's the escort order we issued.

413
00:33:56,841 --> 00:33:58,720
What is Yu Hou doing?

414
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:02,000
Seven and Sixteen didn't have to die.

415
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:04,040
Yu Hou was there and did nothing

416
00:34:04,480 --> 00:34:05,440
just because

417
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:06,921
the Zhang lady was there.

418
00:34:08,752 --> 00:34:10,320
Her martial arts are exceptional.

419
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:12,281
How exceptional?

420
00:34:13,160 --> 00:34:15,536
If she's so skilled,
why does she need to hire anyone?

421
00:34:17,180 --> 00:34:21,980
(Yu Residence)

422
00:34:25,321 --> 00:34:26,440
Hurry up.

423
00:34:30,721 --> 00:34:32,080
Hurry up.

424
00:34:35,080 --> 00:34:36,000
Very good.

425
00:34:40,361 --> 00:34:41,401
Officer Pu,

426
00:34:41,401 --> 00:34:43,921
the horse you rode here
was exposed to the poison.

427
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:46,201
I'm sure you wouldn't want
to ride it again.

428
00:34:46,256 --> 00:34:48,220
The Deputy Military Commissioner
is thoughtful.

429
00:34:48,241 --> 00:34:50,640
There's plenty of food,
drink, and supplies

430
00:34:50,640 --> 00:34:51,881
for your journey.

431
00:34:52,841 --> 00:34:53,841
Two horses.

432
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,560
You can alternate between them.

433
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,080
What do you mean by this?

434
00:34:59,080 --> 00:35:01,520
You've seen what happened
to the Zhang family.

435
00:35:01,921 --> 00:35:03,801
Miss Luyao intends to head west.

436
00:35:04,201 --> 00:35:05,841
You can return directly to the Capital

437
00:35:05,841 --> 00:35:08,520
or go to Ganzhou to see the General.

438
00:35:08,530 --> 00:35:10,160
You're making me leave now?

439
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:12,000
That's not what we mean.

440
00:35:12,120 --> 00:35:14,520
You can rest at the Liangzhou Post.

441
00:35:14,520 --> 00:35:16,128
Then leave first thing tomorrow morning.

442
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:18,400
The Deputy Military Commissioner
has arranged everything.

443
00:35:33,568 --> 00:35:35,088
And this is all you're giving me?

444
00:35:40,921 --> 00:35:42,321
It's not for me to say,

445
00:35:42,520 --> 00:35:45,480
but you refused the 200 taels
of gold offered earlier today.

446
00:35:51,761 --> 00:35:53,640
Everyone wants gold,

447
00:35:54,721 --> 00:35:56,520
but there's something

448
00:35:56,761 --> 00:35:57,960
more important than gold.

449
00:35:59,721 --> 00:36:02,201
What else do you want, Officer?

450
00:36:02,201 --> 00:36:03,321
Respect!

451
00:36:12,560 --> 00:36:14,681
I don't want to raise my voice.

452
00:36:15,520 --> 00:36:16,841
I'm seventh rank.

453
00:36:17,040 --> 00:36:18,281
From the moment I arrived,

454
00:36:18,290 --> 00:36:19,700
a mere Deputy Military Commissioner

455
00:36:19,710 --> 00:36:21,990
has carried himself
with more authority than the General.

456
00:36:22,560 --> 00:36:23,401
Tell him to come out.

457
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:31,440
Officer, the Deputy really isn't here.

458
00:36:32,241 --> 00:36:34,881
I could cut you down
as easily as a chicken.

459
00:36:38,520 --> 00:36:40,520
Those are harsh words, Officer.

460
00:36:41,681 --> 00:36:43,560
We frontier folk don't know any better.

461
00:36:43,648 --> 00:36:46,120
Why don't you just treat me
like a chicken and cut me down?

462
00:36:46,120 --> 00:36:47,721
Come on. Give me a slash.

463
00:36:54,801 --> 00:36:55,600
I will.

464
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:57,040
Just you wait.

465
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:01,721
Get out of my way.

466
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:07,040
Move.

467
00:37:08,321 --> 00:37:08,960
Out of the way.

468
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,440
Move.

469
00:37:12,160 --> 00:37:14,520
You're just looking
to get yourself killed.

470
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:16,480
Officer, please take off your shoes.

471
00:37:27,801 --> 00:37:30,281
I already told you he isn't here.

472
00:37:30,816 --> 00:37:32,920
Then, why are there
so many guards at the door?

473
00:37:33,520 --> 00:37:36,721
They say two assassins
came during the day.

474
00:37:37,321 --> 00:37:38,921
So we're taking extra precautions.

475
00:37:40,841 --> 00:37:41,321
Officer.

476
00:37:41,321 --> 00:37:42,281
Assassins?

477
00:37:43,680 --> 00:37:44,960
Who were they trying to kill?

478
00:37:45,560 --> 00:37:47,520
I wasn't there, either.

479
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:53,281
They say someone from
the Zhang Escort Agency was still alive.

480
00:37:53,281 --> 00:37:56,640
He was brought here,
only to be killed by assassins.

481
00:37:58,080 --> 00:37:59,080
Where are the assassins?

482
00:38:00,520 --> 00:38:02,401
He killed himself.

483
00:38:06,260 --> 00:38:10,500
(Liang)

484
00:38:12,580 --> 00:38:15,841
(Liangzhou Guard)

485
00:38:15,850 --> 00:38:17,456
In Liangzhou, it's only after nightfall

486
00:38:17,472 --> 00:38:19,200
that we get even the slightest breeze.

487
00:38:20,512 --> 00:38:22,768
Didn't they see you come up
to the city wall, Deputy?

488
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:25,120
No.

489
00:38:25,721 --> 00:38:27,440
I just came to say a few words to you.

490
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:32,384
Can I take the meat back
to the barracks and eat it later?

491
00:38:35,361 --> 00:38:37,241
How far have you
been beyond the city walls?

492
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,761
Only three times.

493
00:38:42,528 --> 00:38:45,380
The General pacified the west,
and there hasn't been a war in 10 years.

494
00:38:45,721 --> 00:38:47,000
I'm bored to death.

495
00:38:49,960 --> 00:38:50,721
Deputy,

496
00:38:51,136 --> 00:38:52,880
when are we going back to Lieyang Well?

497
00:38:55,640 --> 00:38:56,721
Lieyang Well...

498
00:38:58,032 --> 00:38:59,840
Six of our men
were poisoned and died there.

499
00:39:00,608 --> 00:39:02,040
Deputy, take me back there to fight.

500
00:39:04,241 --> 00:39:06,241
Today, I met someone remarkable.

501
00:39:08,321 --> 00:39:10,801
I've never left Gansu in all my life.

502
00:39:11,376 --> 00:39:13,824
I've guarded the frontier
with the General since I was young.

503
00:39:13,840 --> 00:39:16,320
I fought my way up from squad leader
to where I am today.

504
00:39:17,401 --> 00:39:20,080
The General entrusted
the Liangzhou Guard to me.

505
00:39:20,761 --> 00:39:21,560
But...

506
00:39:23,040 --> 00:39:25,160
I've never met anyone like her.

507
00:39:26,241 --> 00:39:27,281
Who?

508
00:39:29,401 --> 00:39:30,600
A woman.

509
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:36,721
No one is more remarkable
than the General.

510
00:39:37,536 --> 00:39:38,960
If I'd been born ten years earlier,

511
00:39:39,201 --> 00:39:40,600
I could've followed the General

512
00:39:40,841 --> 00:39:42,080
into battle as you did.

513
00:39:44,040 --> 00:39:46,000
Now I can't even get
an audience with him.

514
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,841
If the General ordered you
to die, would you?

515
00:39:52,608 --> 00:39:54,120
As long as it's the General's order.

516
00:39:57,361 --> 00:39:58,721
I used to feel the same way,

517
00:40:02,761 --> 00:40:04,040
and I still do.

518
00:40:08,048 --> 00:40:10,400
Can I take the meat back
to the barracks and eat it later?

519
00:40:12,361 --> 00:40:14,000
Fang, aren't you going to ask

520
00:40:15,721 --> 00:40:17,960
what kind of woman I met?

521
00:40:20,281 --> 00:40:21,000
I'll ask.

522
00:40:22,080 --> 00:40:23,721
Deputy, what kind of woman did you meet?

523
00:40:37,120 --> 00:40:38,120
This spear

524
00:40:39,120 --> 00:40:41,841
was custom-made for me
by a Persian merchant.

525
00:40:42,881 --> 00:40:45,201
I waited three years for it
to be brought back from Persia.

526
00:40:46,241 --> 00:40:47,401
I've never used it.

527
00:40:48,201 --> 00:40:49,000
Open it.

528
00:40:56,321 --> 00:40:57,080
Smells like iron.

529
00:41:00,120 --> 00:41:01,761
The spear is so short?

530
00:41:13,560 --> 00:41:15,040
You're the best fighter in Liangzhou

531
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:16,304
and most skilled with a spear.

532
00:41:16,801 --> 00:41:17,681
It's yours.

533
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:19,960
It's convenient to carry.

534
00:41:20,201 --> 00:41:21,040
Really?

535
00:41:21,761 --> 00:41:22,520
Yes.

536
00:41:22,801 --> 00:41:23,721
I'm giving it to you.

537
00:41:28,384 --> 00:41:29,800
It's convenient to keep with me?

538
00:41:30,080 --> 00:41:31,120
So where am I going?

539
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:34,480
Lieyang Well,

540
00:41:36,120 --> 00:41:36,881
and then

541
00:41:37,321 --> 00:41:38,440
Shiquan Fort.

542
00:41:40,321 --> 00:41:41,321
When do I leave?

543
00:41:42,721 --> 00:41:43,401
Tomorrow.

544
00:41:44,120 --> 00:41:45,160
You're going alone.

545
00:41:50,881 --> 00:41:52,600
There's a woman
at the Zhang Escort Agency

546
00:41:53,160 --> 00:41:54,080
named Zhang Luyao.

547
00:41:55,401 --> 00:41:56,881
All 27 members of her family

548
00:41:57,936 --> 00:42:00,144
were poisoned to death
by the guardians of the gold.

549
00:42:00,944 --> 00:42:02,350
Just like our men at Lieyang Well?

550
00:42:02,361 --> 00:42:03,321
Listen to me.

551
00:42:04,401 --> 00:42:05,721
Don't ask what you shouldn't.

552
00:42:08,832 --> 00:42:11,480
She's hiring skilled fighters
to head west. You're one of them.

553
00:42:11,480 --> 00:42:13,721
You're not a soldier
of the Liangzhou Guard. Understand?

554
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:15,241
Understood.

555
00:42:15,520 --> 00:42:17,201
In front of her, you're not my brother,

556
00:42:17,761 --> 00:42:19,761
nor are you the General's soldier.
Understand?

557
00:42:21,721 --> 00:42:22,520
Understood.

558
00:42:25,401 --> 00:42:26,841
Do whatever she tells you.

559
00:42:28,120 --> 00:42:30,000
Keep her alive. Understand?

560
00:42:32,120 --> 00:42:34,000
Is she heading west to find the gold?

561
00:42:38,272 --> 00:42:40,560
She's going to find the people
who killed her family.

562
00:42:41,560 --> 00:42:43,321
Who killed her entire family?

563
00:42:50,801 --> 00:42:51,401
Hou,

564
00:42:51,600 --> 00:42:52,801
can I ask one more question?

565
00:42:55,721 --> 00:42:56,321
Ask.

566
00:42:58,000 --> 00:43:00,201
Does the General know
I'm going to find Miss Zhang?

567
00:43:02,721 --> 00:43:03,881
He'll know tomorrow.

568
00:43:07,080 --> 00:43:08,560
I understand everything now.

569
00:43:12,300 --> 00:43:14,700
(Preview of the Next Episode)

570
00:43:15,241 --> 00:43:17,120
Have we planted our man among them?

571
00:43:17,520 --> 00:43:18,321
Yes.

572
00:43:18,401 --> 00:43:19,440
Who are you?

573
00:43:20,201 --> 00:43:21,040
I'm Fang.

574
00:43:21,072 --> 00:43:21,880
I'm here to apply.

575
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:23,800
We put out one recruitment notice,
and two people showed up.

576
00:43:23,960 --> 00:43:25,160
Don't you find that suspicious?

577
00:43:25,721 --> 00:43:26,761
Let's see what you can do.

578
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:28,560
If only one of you is left,

579
00:43:28,608 --> 00:43:30,240
you won't have to split the 200 taels.

580
00:43:40,481 --> 00:43:45,481
=Remnants of Gold=
